 Bedrock extra missing, bug facial-lunar-urson d43e-c24f). Starting epic review-plan.","timestamp":1787868970008874001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S1 6f74 RED evidence: authored 8 reducer tests in tests/unit/test_claimed_session.py. 6 behavioral fail RED for the right reason (clear-on-exit absent): cleared_on_close, cleared_on_exit[blocked/open/idea], fork_winning_exit_clears_holder, exit_clears_holder_e2e. 2 negative controls GREEN (behavior-preserved): persists_while_in_progress, fork_losing_exit_does_not_clear_holder. Next: hold out edge+E2E, dispatch implementer with happy-path only.","timestamp":1787869349706856001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"Epic 1aca review-plan PASS + signed (head_sha 97b003c4, blocking=[]). 3 advisories deferred to surface stories: (1) single-ticket allowlists diverge across S3 CLI/S4 MCP/S5 lib (deps, check_ac, clarity-check); (2) S4 MCP check_ac handler returns GateResultOut which lacks the field. Will reconcile allowlist + carry field where each surface actually emits when implementing S3/S4/S5.","timestamp":1787869656971265001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S1 pre-flight: make lint GREEN, make typecheck GREEN (678 files). Full default suite (pytest -n auto, not integration/external): 17532 passed, 8 failed. The 8 (test_rebar_repo_isolation, test_tracker_footprint_cli x2, test_atomic_completion_close x5) fail IDENTICALLY on pristine origin/main with my change stashed -> pre-existing local-macOS git-remote harness failures (git show-ref/ls-tree exit 128), NOT caused by S1; they pass in CI Linux Verified leg. Reducer suite 19/19 green incl held-out oracle; sandboxed mutation teeth confirmed. Proceeding to commit+push S1.","timestamp":1787875370545854001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S1 6f74 pushed to Gerrit: change 2302 (https://rebar.solutions.navateam.com/c/rebar/+/2302), commit 35b480022ceb, Change-Id Ie44f8dc2. Trailers verified (rebar-ticket + DCO + Change-Id). Awaiting LLM-Review +1 and Verified +1.","timestamp":1787875475495546001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S1 6f74 Gerrit change 2302 MERGED: LLM-Review +1 (rebar review bot) AND Verified +1 (rebar CI bot). Closing S1 via completion-verifier gate.","timestamp":1787876879856327001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S1 (6f74) CLOSED via completion-verifier after checking 7 AC boxes. Change MERGED as origin/main 8e2e389. Worktree reset --hard to origin/main. S2 (0804) unblocked. Proceeding: review-plan S2 -> claim -> held-out TDD.","timestamp":1787877200469157001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S2 (0804) review-plan: 1st run BLOCK (E4: plan Scope omitted _SECTION_CLASSES entry + Config field required by Config.from_mapping). Remediated Approach+Scope to name all 4 wiring sites. Re-run PASS+signed (head 8e2e389). Applied E6 advisory (anchored 'revisit' grep in AC5). CLAIMED S2. Authored full oracle tests/unit/test_cross_session.py (RED: 4 behavioral fail on stub, 6 suppression negative-controls pass). Held out suppression matrix + message-content + config-toggle E2E to files/S2_full_oracle.py; happy-path only in tree. Dispatching implementer.","timestamp":1787878202899531001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S2 (0804) implemented (held-out oracle 10/10 GREEN; sandboxed mutation teeth: same-session-guard drop -> suppression RED, harness-paren drop -> message RED; restore GREEN). Reverted 67 unrelated ruff-format reformats (ruff format normalized .md/.py fenced blocks outside make lint scope); kept 6 scoped files. lint+typecheck+drift GREEN, 427 config/detector tests pass. Committed 22f43c7 (Change-Id I39c36deb). Pushed Gerrit change 2303. Polling votes.","timestamp":1787878830166436001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S2 (0804): fixed CI module-size overflow by moving coercion cluster (_ALIASES, _RESERVED_SECTIONS, coerce_sparse, merge_sparse) from _config_schema.py (808->733 LOC) into _config_sections.py (153->242 LOC), re-exported for back-compat. Also added warnings.cross_session to hand-authored docs/config.md (LLM-Review advisory). All green locally: lint, typecheck (680 files), check_config_reads, gen_config_reference --check, module-size (all <=800), 743 config tests + cross_session oracle. Amended commit b21554c (Change-Id I39c36deb preserved), re-pushed patchset to Gerrit 2303. Awaiting LLM-Review + Verified.","timestamp":1787880642923793001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S2 (0804): patchset 2 CI failed on TWO real Linux-only findings (module-size fix ran the full suite for the first time): (1) test_build_drift referenced rebar._config_schema._warn_unknown by attribute path — ruff had dropped that + _src as F401 during the split; restored both as redundant-alias re-exports. (2) ARG ratchet (test_arg_sweep_kwargs_heldout) hit 26>25: implementer's cross_session_warning_for had a vestigial unused 'tracker' param; removed it (+ updated the 2 oracle call sites). Local: lint/typecheck(680)/config-reads/gen-config-reference/module-size all green; ARG back to 25; 3 previously-failing tests + oracle green. Amended (Change-Id preserved), pushed patchset 3 to Gerrit 2303.","timestamp":1787882266705948001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S2 (0804) LANDED + CLOSED. Gerrit 2303 MERGED as 65208a7ef81c on main (LLM-Review+1 + Verified+1, manual Submit). Reset worktree to merged main. Close required: (a) re-run review-plan (post-review E6 edit had staled the attestation) -> PASS signed at 65208a7; (b) widen file_impact 4->7 (implementer also touched scripts/gen_config_reference.py, docs/config.md, and the test) -> material change -> re-ran review-plan -> PASS 0/0 signed; (c) checked all 5 AC boxes. transition closed PASSED completion-verifier. Unblocked S3 5d55 (CLI), S4 734d (MCP), S5 3d8a (library). Proceeding to surface stories (independent; stack in order).","timestamp":1787884952420204001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S3 (5d55 CLI) plan-review PASS+signed at 65208a7 (fixed S2 prereq text: dropped tracker from cross_session_warning_for signature; added link-primary + best-effort-swallow ACs). Claimed 5d55 in_progress. Starting held-out TDD.","timestamp":1787887583518239001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S3 held-out TDD: authored 8-test CLI oracle (real python -m rebar subprocess). RED confirmed: 3 warn-expecting tests fail because 'another session' absent from stderr (feature unbuilt); 5 silence controls pass trivially (gain teeth post-impl). Held out 6 edge/E2E tests to files/S3_heldout_oracle.py; kept happy-path show-warns + same-session-silent in tests/unit/test_cross_session_cli.py. Dispatching implementer.","timestamp":1787887943419905001},{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","body":"S3 implemented (single seam in _cli/_execute.py: allowlist frozenset + best-effort stderr WARN, lazy import). Held-out oracle: 9/9 green incl. mutation teeth (link-primary, same-session, unset-id, config-toggle all catch regressions in sandbox). make lint + typecheck + 992 CLI tests green. file_impact set to 3 actual files; AC boxes checked; review-plan PASS+signed at 65208a7. Committed 75f8aebf, pushed Gerrit 2309.","timestamp":1787889590201357001}],"created_at":1787868877112777001,"creation_channel":"cli","deps":[{"link_uuid":"3770a391-897d-47d4-a1dd-c2966a8fa31a","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"1aca-695f-a0a4-4236"},{"link_uuid":"7d432adc-b21c-4a38-b4e6-1ec4dd1ca229","relation":"relates_to","target_id":"6f74-2795-5ad4-4a56"}],"description":"","env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","file_impact":[],"file_impact_scope":"undeclared","keyring":[],"managed_refs":[["relates_to","1aca-695f-a0a4-4236"],["relates_to","6f74-2795-5ad4-4a56"]],"no_file_impact_reason":"","parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"","plan_review_phase":"planning","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"repos":[],"reverts":[],"status":"open","tags":[],"ticket_id":"524d-22a5-1a21-49d7","ticket_type":"session_log","title":"Implement concave-pale-sheldrake: cross-session warning epic","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["46a09997-fda0-4b3a-8bd5-a53ac9c09d10","dce60e63-7311-4833-8bcc-7cb958900df9","bfc2d1a3-7dfd-4725-b987-db8cb148fb3c","c75856ec-d47a-4436-811f-259ec0f0d39c","a7563ddb-4b4b-4dd4-a3f8-379ab32f9bdc","2e165fb1-116b-4f0a-a622-6ff2def096d1","94785f6b-3d56-4464-93b1-192ec5f2419f","073f7d89-e9fa-4280-874c-a2e01afdc327","cf47925a-3f6a-4c06-9c2d-e5f1c765be57","20439286-5696-41f2-837d-d6a60e7d22d4","d0086a00-b2b8-4f0c-b9f3-40baef1ebe80","10af71f3-5e47-4d5a-82eb-24cb4f18e2bb"]},"env_id":"b8a354e0-12c3-4cf2-bbf1-fcc9685d5126","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1787889590201357002,"uuid":"29ece339-5edd-4419-9b1f-5dce07e691b1"}